KittenTTS for Sigil
===================

This directory contains source code vendored from kittentts 0.3.0
(https://crates.io/crates/kittentts, https://github.com/eugenehp/kittentts-rs),
the Rust port of KittenTTS (https://github.com/KittenML/KittenTTS).

